{"title":"Career Roadmap · Irrigation Engineer","role":"Irrigation Engineer","summary":"An Irrigation Engineer plans, designs, develops, operates, and maintains systems that deliver water efficiently to agricultural land. The role combines hydrology, hydraulics, soil-water relationships, irrigation systems, drainage, surveying, water-resource engineering, agricultural science, and increasingly GIS/remote sensing and automation.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Canal and pipeline systems"},{"text":"Drip and sprinkler irrigation"},{"text":"Pumping systems"},{"text":"Water-storage structures"},{"text":"Farm water distribution"},{"text":"Irrigation scheduling"},{"text":"Drainage systems"},{"text":"Watershed projects"},{"text":"Water-use efficiency"},{"text":"Irrigation modernization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agricultural Engineering","Irrigation & Drainage","Hydraulics","Water Resources","GIS/Smart Irrigation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Typical career stage","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Graduate / Junior Irrigation Engineer"},{"text":"Surveying, irrigation design, hydraulics, field execution"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Irrigation / Water Resources Engineer"},{"text":"System design, project implementation, water management"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Irrigation Engineer"},{"text":"Large irrigation projects, watershed management, technical leadership"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Irrigation / Water Resources Manager"},{"text":"Regional water systems, project management, policy and resource planning"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Main objective","Key skills","Pro